		{"id":"a2480cb99083ad44","type":"text","text":"**Physically-based simulation**\n* Volumes/grids: Eulerian\n* Particles/points: Lagrangian\n* Hybrid: voxels and particles, e.g. FLIP: https://matthias-research.github.io/pages/tenMinutePhysics/18-flip.pdf","x":-9052,"y":-397,"width":680,"height":210},
